{{Otheruses|A type of historical town|The former municipality in Hōsu District, Ishikawa Prefecture (now Wajima City)|{{ill|Monzen Town (Ishikawa)|ja|門前町 (石川県)}}|For other uses, see {{ill|Monzen Town (disambiguation)|ja|門前町 (曖昧さ回避)}}.}}{{Cite sources clearly|date=June 8, 2015 (Mon) 05:51 (UTC)}}
