* [[Sagatoriimoto]] - {{ill|Kyoto Prefecture|ja|京都府}}, {{ill|Kyoto City|ja|京都市}}, {{ill|Ukyo Ward|ja|右京区}} - {{ill|Atago Shrine|ja|愛宕神社}}
* [[Sannenzaka]] - Kyoto City, {{ill|Higashiyama Ward|ja|東山区}} - {{ill|Kiyomizu-dera|ja|清水寺}}


