* [[Sagatoriimoto]] - {{ill|Kyoto Prefecture|ja|京都府|qq=draft}}, {{ill|Kyoto City|ja|京都市|qq=draft}}, {{ill|Ukyo Ward|ja|右京区|1=Ukyō-ku, Kyoto|qq=draft}} - {{ill|Atago Shrine|ja|愛宕神社|qq=draft}}
* [[Sannenzaka]] - Kyoto City, {{ill|Higashiyama Ward|ja|東山区|qq=draft}} - {{ill|Kiyomizu-dera|ja|清水寺|qq=draft}}

