* {{ill|Saga-Toriimoto|ja|嵯峨鳥居本|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Saga-Toriimoto|qq=}} - [[:en:Kyoto|Kyoto]], [[:en:Kyoto Prefecture|Kyoto Prefecture]] - [[:en:Atago Shrine (Kyoto)|Atago Shrine]]
